          "_name": "team1",
          "_sourceTheme": "masterclassm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"team1\" group=\"Team\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleM\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/masterclassm5/components/_images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitleM\">\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showTitleM\" class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    Fundadores</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card mb-5\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-3 mb-sm-0\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/8d-340-232x348.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" class=\"rounded-circle bc1\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box p-0\">\n                                <div class=\"row\">\n                                    <div class=\"col-12\">\n                                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 text-uppercase\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Pastor josé maría silvestri</b></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"></p>\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><i>“La educación es un factor esencial para el crecimiento personal. La ignorancia no es una virtud, es una desgracia que empobrece al ser humano.”\n                                        </i></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"></p>\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><i>“Desde el principio nuestro lema fue y sigue siendo “La escuela de la Excelencia”, y por lo tanto siempre estamos desafiados a superarnos.”</i><br></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-3 mb-sm-0\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/foto-pastora-232x390.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" class=\"rounded-circle bc2\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box p-0\">\n                                <div class=\"row\">\n                                    <div class=\"col-12\">\n                                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 text-uppercase\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>pastora mabel silvestri</b></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"></p>\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><i>“Necesitamos establecer un nuevo modelo en el ámbito educativo. La escuela actual necesita una transformación profunda y radical. Debemos poner de pie a esta generación.”\n                                        </i></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\"></p>\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><i>“Los niños y adolescentes tienen mucho para dar, sus acciones de amor y fe, son un aporte significativo para cambiar y mejorar la realidad de hoy.”\n</i><br>\n<br></p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tc2UclL8b4",
          "_anchor": "team1-1s",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
